{
  "_note": "单个事项的 30 天窗口 + 全部统计 + 主题色。入参 {itemId, mask}（绑定处必须写 {flow, params}，裸绑定传空入参 = 整卡 `--` 且不报错）。\n⚠️ 每格的**最终色**在这里算完（c0..c29），RCN 只写 `${c0}` —— 六色调色板 × 四档浓淡若摊进 RCN，每格要 24 个分支、30 格就是 720 个。这里按 pal 选一次三档色存进变量，每格只剩 4 个分支。",
  "version": 1,
  "actions": [
    {
      "_note": "入参先落地成 data 域的键(§9.5 #3),再由 resultFilter 透出去 —— **RCN 只看得见 flow 的输出**,shell params 不进渲染域。`mask` 决定卡上打不打码(打码开关在事项页,经 pickWidgets 的 per-item params 传进来)。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "mask",
        "value": "${mask}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "sk",
        "value": "stat_${itemId}"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "零网络：全部数据来自包级 data.* 沙盒（页面 H5 写入）。byDay 是「不随时间变」的真源桶，近 30 天窗口在**读时**按今天投影 —— 写时算好的滚动数组会随日期过期，而 VParser 没有变量下标可以补偿（标准 §4.5 #1）。",
      "id": "s",
      "action": "data.get",
      "params": {
        "key": "${sk}",
        "default": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "byDay",
        "value": "${s.byDay}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "pal",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${s.pal},1)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "goalRaw",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${s.goal},1)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "目标下限钉 1:0 或空会让「达标」恒真,连续天数就成了「有没有打开过 App」。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "goal",
        "value": "$[if::(ge::(${goalRaw},1),${goalRaw},1)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "icon",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${s.icon},)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "有没有图标 —— RCN 没有「按内容让位」的排版，名字的起点要靠两条 op:if 分支切，不能只画一个空的图标位（空图标会在名字左边留一块说不清的白）。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "hicon",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${icon},_),_),0,1)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "iname",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${s.name},)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "主题色(浅|深)。⚠️ `|` 由 StaticCanvas 核心对**最终字符串**切分(source_scene_paint_internal.cpp `sc_select_dark_paint_branch`),所以运行时算出来的 `#AAA|#BBB` 一样能分明暗 —— 主题色才能跟着事项走。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "mc",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${pal},1),#2E9E6B|#45C793,if::(eq::(${pal},2),#2F6FE4|#5C9BFF,if::(eq::(${pal},3),#7A5AF8|#A78BFA,if::(eq::(${pal},4),#E07B39|#F0A05F,if::(eq::(${pal},5),#D2536D|#E87A93,#0E9AA7|#35C2CE)))))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "hp1",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${pal},1),#7ABEA0|#3A896C,if::(eq::(${pal},2),#7BA2E9|#486FAD,if::(eq::(${pal},3),#A895F5|#7565AA,if::(eq::(${pal},4),#E5A982|#A1724D,if::(eq::(${pal},5),#DD91A1|#9C5B6C,#67BCC4|#318690)))))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "hp2",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${pal},1),#54AE86|#40A880,if::(eq::(${pal},2),#5588E6|#5285D6,if::(eq::(${pal},3),#9178F6|#8E78D2,if::(eq::(${pal},4),#E3925E|#C88956,if::(eq::(${pal},5),#D77287|#C26A80,#3BABB6|#33A4AF)))))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "hp3",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${pal},1),#2E9E6B|#45C793,if::(eq::(${pal},2),#2F6FE4|#5C9BFF,if::(eq::(${pal},3),#7A5AF8|#A78BFA,if::(eq::(${pal},4),#E07B39|#F0A05F,if::(eq::(${pal},5),#D2536D|#E87A93,#0E9AA7|#35C2CE)))))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "e0",
        "value": "#EDEEF0|#20232A"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "mk",
        "value": "#DCDDE0|#33353B"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "nowMs",
        "value": "${@time.nowMs}"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "按自然日归零再相减，否则同一天的上午/下午会算出不同天数（同 moment/countdown.df）。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "todayMs",
        "value": "$[parseDate::(formatDate::(${nowMs},yyyy-MM-dd),yyyy-MM-dd)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "todayKey",
        "value": "$[formatDate::(${nowMs},yyyy-MM-dd)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "k0",
        "value": "$[formatDate::(calc::(${todayMs}-0),yyyy-MM-dd)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "v0",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(get::(${byDay},${k0}),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "「这天算不算完成」= 次数 ≥ 每日目标。⚠️ 不是 >0 —— 目标 3 次时只打 1 次不该算达标，否则连续天数会把「敷衍的一天」也串进去。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "h0",
        "value": "$[if::(ge::(${v0},${goal}),1,0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "c0",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${mask},1),${mk},if::(eq::(${v0},0),${e0},if::(ge::(${v0},${goal}),${hp3},if::(ge::(calc::(${v0}*2),${goal}),${hp2},${hp1}))))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "k1",
        "value": "$[formatDate::(calc::(${todayMs}-86400000),yyyy-MM-dd)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "v1",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(get::(${byDay},${k1}),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "h1",
        "value": "$[if::(ge::(${v1},${goal}),1,0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "c1",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${mask},1),${mk},if::(eq::(${v1},0),${e0},if::(ge::(${v1},${goal}),${hp3},if::(ge::(calc::(${v1}*2),${goal}),${hp2},${hp1}))))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "k2",
        "value": "$[formatDate::(calc::(${todayMs}-172800000),yyyy-MM-dd)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "v2",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(get::(${byDay},${k2}),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "h2",
        "value": "$[if::(ge::(${v2},${goal}),1,0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "c2",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${mask},1),${mk},if::(eq::(${v2},0),${e0},if::(ge::(${v2},${goal}),${hp3},if::(ge::(calc::(${v2}*2),${goal}),${hp2},${hp1}))))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "k3",
        "value": "$[formatDate::(calc::(${todayMs}-259200000),yyyy-MM-dd)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "v3",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(get::(${byDay},${k3}),0)]"
